{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维篇","docCount":3,"url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"i18n-testing-automation","title":"国际化测试与自动化","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-testing-automation","wordCount":1324,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"rtl-bidirectional-support","title":"RTL 与双向文本支持","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/rtl-bidirectional-support","wordCount":1513,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"i18n-performance-caching","title":"国际化性能与缓存","url":"/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/operations/i18n-performance-caching","wordCount":1538,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 运维篇\n\n运维篇覆盖国际化系统上线后的持续保障。i18n 缺陷往往在特定 locale 下才暴露——阿拉伯语的 RTL 文本在邮件模板中错位、日语的长文本撑破缓存键、伪本地化发现的硬编码字符串在生产环境中泄露。三篇文档分别处理测试自动化策略、双向文本的后端支持、以及 locale 数据加载的性能优化与缓存设计。\n"}